          "id": "spme-convergence",
          "title": {
            "ja": "SPME：格子・補間次数・格子位相と保存則",
            "en": "SPME: mesh, interpolation order, mesh phase and conservation"
          },
          "method_ids": [
            "pme",
            "spme"
          ],
          "summary": {
            "ja": "BスプラインSPMEを同じ独立theta参照へ照合し、格子・次数・位相への依存、電荷の保持、エネルギー勾配と合力を測ります。",
            "en": "Compare B-spline SPME with the same independent theta reference; measure mesh/order/phase effects, charge partition, energy gradients and net force."
          },
          "assumptions": {
            "ja": "同じ中性周期8電荷、alpha=5.6、実空間像3。PME族のEssmann型SPMEであり、1993年のLagrange補間の原法とは区別します。",
            "en": "Same neutral periodic eight-charge cell, alpha=5.6 and three real-space image shells. This is Essmann-style SPME in the PME family, distinct from the original 1993 Lagrange interpolation."
          },
          "algorithm": {
            "ja": "16³/24³/40³格子と4/6次Bスプライン、3つの平行移動位相を用います。FFT逆空間エネルギーを割当て重みで位置微分し、実空間・自己項はEwald主計算と共有します。",
            "en": "Use 16³/24³/40³ meshes, orders four/six and three translations relative to the mesh. Differentiate FFT reciprocal energy through assignment weights; real/self terms share the primary Ewald implementation."
          },
          "validation": {
            "ja": "独立thetaエネルギー・全力との差と、共有Ewald経路自体の誤差を明記します。分配の総和・導関数総和、電荷、エネルギー差分3成分、位相間の幅、有限格子の合力と粗い格子の対照を保存します。",
            "en": "Report full energy/force errors against theta integration and explicitly check the shared Ewald path. Store assignment and derivative sums, charge, three finite-difference derivatives, phase spread, finite-mesh net force and a coarse-mesh control."
          },
          "limits": {
            "ja": "エネルギー勾配型では有限格子のaliasingにより合力は一般にゼロではありません。厳密な運動量保存や任意配置での同じ誤差、長時間MD、原法PME、SPME全変種の検証とはしません。",
            "en": "Finite-mesh aliasing generally gives nonzero net force for this energy-gradient variant. No exact momentum conservation, arbitrary-configuration error bound, long MD, original PME or every SPME variant is certified."
          },
          "equations": [
            "\\mathbf F_i=-\\partial E_h/\\partial\\mathbf r_i",
            "\\sum_j M_p(u-j)=1,\\qquad\\sum_j M_p^{\\prime}(u-j)=0"
          ],
